          "term": "$default-branch",
          "explanation": "範本內的佔位符，建立時被換成 repository 的預設分支名。",
          "exams": ["GH-200"],
          "category": "使用與疑難排解工作流程"
        },
        {
          "id": "D2-T21",
          "term": "Disable workflow",
